rooms_desc ({"Here rises one that wants to travel in time, so....You step into Nylakoorub's Time Machine, and vanish....Then you find yourself trapped in the past, seeing places that are notof your own time, and driven by a unknown force to change history for thebetter.Your only guide is Nylakoorub, an observer from your own time, who appearsin the form of a hologram, that only you can see and hear, so you travelfrom time period to time period, making right from what went wrong andhoping that your final time period is your own.	To the North is a portal to circa 1776, to the west is a portal tocirca 1990's, to the east is a portal to circa 1860's, and to the southis a door to the Great Hall of Time.","You have arrived in circa 1776...	You are standing in Philadelphia, in colonial america.  The air isclean and fresh here.	To the North is building with a bell staple, and you can hear it ringfrom miles around.	To the North is a door into the building, and to the South is a portal, enter if you dare....","You have arrived in circa 1860s...	You are standing on a large battlefield in Gettysburg.  You see theUnion army entrenched on the high ground.  The confederates are waiting inthick trees, waiting for the advance of Pickett's charge.	To the North is the way to Washington, to the South is the way toRichmound and to the west is a portal, enter if you dare..","This is the entrance way of Indenpence Hall.	To the west is the assembly room of the colonial congress andto the south is a door to the outside..","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","You have arrived in circa 1990s....	You are standing in front of a large building made of brick.  It lookslike some type of college residence hall.  It is mid-winter, and there isa lot of snow on the ground.	You see a large sign above the west, and a man in front of the building shoveling snow, he looks tall and skinny.	To the west is a door to Nylakoorub's dorm room, but it is locked andonly he can open it and let you in for a peep.  To the east is a strangelooking portal, enter it if you dare...","	This is the assembly room for the colonial congress.  There are 13tables and One large table in the front of the room.	In the back corner is a elderly man rockin in a wooden chair.To the east is a door out...","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","You have entered Nylakoorub's dorm room.....	To the left side of the room, is Nylakoorub very powerful computerand a very large entertainment center with a 21\" TV, VCR, CD playerSuper Nintendo and a large collection of movies.	On the right side is Nylakoorub's bed, On the back is his kitchenwith a freezer and refrigator.	On the walls are many poster, take a look at them all.There are exits to the church, guild, shop and back east.",})
